1
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:14,540
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,518
You're on the move!

3
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,488
Pharaoh, are you all right?

4
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:08,200
We're outnumbered. Let us go!

5
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:15,520
What a coward.

6
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:16,860
Don't be fooled.

7
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:20,652
Bakura's retreat may be an
attempt to lead us into a trap.

8
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,897
Captain, have your men follow him.

9
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:26,917
Then have the Royal Guard evacuate
all civilians to the palace courtyard.

10
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:27,830
Yes, sir.

11
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:35,777
Everyone's in the palace courtyard!

12
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:37,095
You'll be safe there!

13
00:01:37,660 --> 00:01:40,013
There's no sign of the pharaoh anywhere!

14
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,460
He can't be too far!

15
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,980
Look up there!

16
00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:45,780
It's Slyper the Sky Dragon!

17
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:48,640
Now I call upon Duos!

18
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:50,220
Crack down Bacora!

19
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,320
I summon Helamai!

20
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,190
Careful!

21
00:01:57,273 --> 00:01:58,120
It could be near!

22
00:01:58,380 --> 00:01:59,440
It hides by night!

23
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,420
Well put, Pharaoh.

24
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,460
Oh, no!

25
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,150
Kareem!

26
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:16,188
If we're to defeat him,
you must stand tall.

27
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:19,297
Now wipe the sweat from your
brow and rise above this.

28
00:02:19,380 --> 00:02:21,420
The fate of Egypt depends upon it.

29
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,800
Yes, you're right.

30
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:24,140
I will be fine.

31
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:27,297
But there is no telling
where that creature lurks.

32
00:02:27,380 --> 00:02:29,380
Or where it will strike next.

33
00:02:32,180 --> 00:02:33,700
Pharoah! Wait!

34
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,840
We must follow! Right!

35
00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:44,074
Bakura has already become
more powerful than I imagined!

36
00:02:44,220 --> 00:02:47,691
He must be stopped before he
gains another Millennium Idol!

37
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:56,100
Who knew his highness could
be led astray so easily?

38
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:59,260
Your reign ends now, Pharoah!

39
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:03,180
Go, Slifer!

40
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,800
Seek and destroy!

41
00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:17,380
Let's finish this, right now!

42
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:26,097
The time has come.

43
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:27,740
Farewell, Pharaoh.

44
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:35,380
How can we defend ourselves
from an enemy we cannot see?

45
00:03:35,660 --> 00:03:40,660
Our pharaoh controls the Egyptian gods,
the most powerful beings in this realm.

46
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:44,420
I've kept you in suspense long enough.

47
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:47,680
Now, Diabal, time to make yourself known.

48
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,278
Biblical Shockwave!

49
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:52,000
Sliver, it's your turn!

50
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:54,081
Attack with Thunder Force Strike!

51
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:23,100
Ah, Master Agnardin!

52
00:04:28,260 --> 00:04:30,840
It's up to you, Seto

53
00:04:31,980 --> 00:04:34,420
Duos, or a sword attack

54
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,440
A direct hit

55
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,900
Good work, Seto

56
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:46,340
You really think you destroyed Deerbound?

57
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:48,160
Not even close, Pharo

58
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:57,100
Another monster? But how?

59
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:02,840
I'm afraid there's not a strategy
I haven't prepared for, gentlemen.

60
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:05,920
Must fight on.

61
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:10,440
Please, Farrow, you are
far too weak for this.

62
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:13,660
I can't give up now.

63
00:05:15,700 --> 00:05:17,460
Farrow! No!

64
00:05:24,540 --> 00:05:25,780
Yugi, is that you?

65
00:05:25,940 --> 00:05:27,160
So you can see me.

66
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:29,080
Are you all right? Pharaoh?

67
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,301
What's going on?

68
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:31,980
You shouldn't be here.

69
00:05:32,220 --> 00:05:34,220
It's too dangerous. Impossible.

70
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:38,117
How could those four brats
have infiltrated this realm?

71
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:40,847
We've come too far to
turn back now, Pharaoh.

72
00:05:41,100 --> 00:05:42,924
You and I are a team, remember?

73
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,020
This is incredible.

74
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:47,520
I can feel my energy returning.

75
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:51,520
I forgot how strong my
bond with you he truly is.

76
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:59,080
Akura, your reign of
terror ends here and now.

77
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:03,027
You've disgraced the Egyptian
gods, and for that you must pay.

78
00:06:03,980 --> 00:06:06,660
Come forth, winged dragon of Rara.

79
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:24,460
cast thy rage upon this enemy of egypt no
how can he summon a beast this powerful

80
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:38,940
can it be the Egyptian sun god
the mighty winged dragon of Ra

81
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:49,057
this doesn't make any sense
when I destroyed Slifer

82
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:52,081
the sky dragon the pharaoh
was rendered powerless,

83
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:56,700
so where did he find the strength to
call upon yet another Egyptian god?

84
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:02,580
Ah, unless this has something
to do with those meddling kids,

85
00:07:03,060 --> 00:07:08,000
did reuniting with his former host
somehow restore the pharaoh's life force?

86
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:10,990
Yugi,

87
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:17,200
once again we shall save mankind together,
and I wouldn't have it any other way.

88
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:23,320
Isis, look!

89
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:28,111
Only the gods of Egypt can cause the
sun to illuminate in the dead of night.

90
00:07:30,180 --> 00:07:34,220
Without the darkness, his Diabound
has no way of concealing itself.

91
00:07:34,540 --> 00:07:35,820
Let us attack now!

92
00:07:36,140 --> 00:07:37,560
Can't you fool see?

93
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:42,900
Thanks to the Pharaoh, I wield the power
of an Egyptian god as well. Diabound!

94
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,394
Thunder Force, attack!

95
00:07:45,740 --> 00:07:46,700
Oh no!

96
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,430
Pharaoh!

97
00:07:49,513 --> 00:07:53,200
I shall protect you with my mighty duos!

98
00:07:57,700 --> 00:08:01,077
Use the power of your aura
sword to stop Makora's

99
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:04,040
attack and shield the
winged dragon from harm!

100
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:10,500
Can't you see this doesn't concern you?

101
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:12,740
Pharaoh, now's your chance!

102
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:18,000
Great deity of the sun, I ask
thee to transform thyself!

103
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:26,220
Now, burn through the
shadows with your fiery rage!

104
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,640
Justice is served.

105
00:08:44,860 --> 00:08:46,500
The darkness is no more.

106
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:48,200
I hope you're right.

107
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:56,140
This creature is destroyed!

108
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:59,875
And the Pharaoh has restored
peace to Egypt once again!

109
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:07,060
Am I too late to help?

110
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:12,860
Had it not been for Yugi's bravery, Bakura
would surely have reigned victorious.

111
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:17,680
But once again, it seems
that friendship conquers all.

112
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,480
I take it, you just won, right?

113
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:25,891
Yes, Egypt is now safe, but none of it
would have been possible without you.

114
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:27,530
Oh, come on!

115
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:29,617
You're the one that did all the work!

116
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:33,800
But you gave me the strength I
needed to fight, so thank you.

117
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,489
Like I said, we're a team!

118
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:38,834
Hey, don't forget the rest of the team!

119
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,820
All for one!

120
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:41,200
And one for all!

121
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:42,737
How did I know this was coming?

122
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:47,800
You see, Pharaoh, even two continents in
over 5,000 years couldn't keep us apart.

123
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:49,420
Oh, Buzz is touched.

124
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:51,080
I love a happy ending.

125
00:09:52,620 --> 00:09:54,780
It wasn't supposed to end like this.

126
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,580
In fact, I won't let it.

127
00:09:57,480 --> 00:10:01,720
Hands of time, reverse thyself
so that I may alter the past.

128
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,480
It's a twister!

129
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,940
My king, we must leave now.

130
00:10:12,820 --> 00:10:13,650
This can't be!

131
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:15,389
Is time flowing backwards?

132
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,360
Hold on, Trio!

133
00:10:28,820 --> 00:10:29,650
Yugi!

134
00:10:30,660 --> 00:10:32,420
Yugi! Don't go!

135
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:47,260
Now, to pick up where I left off!

136
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:53,700
My barrow!

137
00:11:00,540 --> 00:11:02,917
Is it me, or did we run
through this town already?

138
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,830
It's not you!

139
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:06,220
I'm having some major deja vu, dude!

140
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:12,117
What have you done, Bakura? Tell me!

141
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,160
Hello!

142
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:15,560
Just look.

143
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:17,760
I brought back some time.

144
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:19,210
Diabow.

145
00:11:19,293 --> 00:11:21,440
Let's try this again, shall we?

146
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:32,120
I think he's gone.

147
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:37,980
It seems the tables have turned.

148
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,340
What do you want?

149
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:41,660
I want what's rightfully mine.

150
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:43,960
Your puzzle!

151
00:11:44,380 --> 00:11:45,600
But don't worry.

152
00:11:45,860 --> 00:11:49,760
Where you're going, you'll
have no use for it. Pharaoh!

153
00:11:53,180 --> 00:11:54,900
Join the Shadow Realm.

154
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,800
What have you done, Vakura?

155
00:11:58,820 --> 00:11:59,980
Hurry, Karim.

156
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:02,259
We must lead a search for the king.

157
00:12:02,580 --> 00:12:03,560
This way, men!

158
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:05,730
Vakura!

159
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:07,432
This is for the Pharaoh!

160
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:12,620
I like your style.

161
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:13,860
I can use you.

162
00:12:15,580 --> 00:12:17,300
Can we talk about this?

163
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,720
Hey, Scarface!

164
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:21,600
Let my pal go! Fine!

165
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:25,460
You fools!

166
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:27,200
You're no match for us!

167
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,190
Us?

168
00:12:29,273 --> 00:12:30,660
Oh, man.

169
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:32,837
I thought he was working alone.

170
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,214
And you thought wrong.

171
00:12:38,420 --> 00:12:40,320
You must hurry, my friends!

172
00:12:40,580 --> 00:12:41,560
Run this way!

173
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:42,880
I know a shotgun!

174
00:12:47,580 --> 00:12:49,960
I'm in control of this shadow game,

175
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:54,395
and reversing the hands of time was
a mere taste of what I'm capable of!

176
00:12:58,900 --> 00:13:02,820
Now, I have five more
Millennium items to seize!

177
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:08,980
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

178
00:13:17,780 --> 00:13:20,140
You are all safe now, my friends.

179
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:23,720
All except for one. Tristan's right.

180
00:13:23,900 --> 00:13:25,488
We got to find the pharaoh.

181
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:29,140
But this was a shadow
game and, well, he lost.

182
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,160
What are you saying?

183
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,499
She's got a point.

184
00:13:32,780 --> 00:13:36,133
Everyone we know that lost a
shadow game lost their soul.

185
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,600
Not this time.

186
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:40,078
I'm telling you, the Pharaoh's okay.

187
00:13:40,740 --> 00:13:42,160
Think about it, guys.

188
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,951
Remember what Shadi said?

189
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:46,597
We're in the world of
the Pharaoh's memories.

190
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:47,940
I don't follow you.

191
00:13:48,180 --> 00:13:49,121
Look around you.

192
00:13:49,340 --> 00:13:50,977
Everything's still here, isn't it?

193
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:53,001
So the Pharaoh must be here, too.

194
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:54,760
Oh, I get it.

195
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:58,099
If his memories are still
here, then he's here, too.

196
00:13:58,860 --> 00:14:02,625
So now all we have to do is search
this place until we find him.

197
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:04,337
How are we supposed to do that?

198
00:14:04,420 --> 00:14:06,480
We got this far, didn't we?

199
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:08,859
The rest should be a piece of cake.

200
00:14:15,580 --> 00:14:18,220
Will Bakura's evil rampage never cease?

201
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:21,880
First Mahad was attacked,
and now Master Akhnadhan?

202
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:26,640
Please, Millennium Key, guide his spirit.

203
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:33,917
Agnaden, are you all right?

204
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,176
Please, speak to me.

205
00:14:35,860 --> 00:14:39,320
Shadda, have you found
any strong souls? Yes.

206
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:40,697
As a matter of fact,

207
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:43,417
Seto and I came across a
young peasant girl who's

208
00:14:43,500 --> 00:14:46,677
harboring a creature so powerful
it could not be measured.

209
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:50,520
Her power was even too strong
for the Millennium Key to detect?

210
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:55,057
Please, with all due respect,
you need your rest, sir.

211
00:14:55,140 --> 00:14:56,420
Out of my way!

212
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,060
Wait! Master!

213
00:15:00,300 --> 00:15:01,820
My apologies, sir.

214
00:15:02,060 --> 00:15:05,377
We have scoured the kingdom and
still no sign of the pharaoh.

215
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:10,740
Even if you have to drain the river Nile,
I want him found! Yes, sir. Know this.

216
00:15:10,980 --> 00:15:13,100
His majesty still walks this earth.

217
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:17,420
And if we expect Egypt to survive,
our king must return to the throne.

218
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,360
Isis, can you see what the future holds?

219
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:24,460
One tiny ripple moves
across a sea of shadows.

220
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:28,340
As it spreads, one among us will vanish.

221
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:30,200
More ripples will follow,

222
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:33,909
and before long they will merge
to form a devastating force.

223
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:35,680
Time is running out.

224
00:15:36,060 --> 00:15:38,942
Isis, does this foretell
the fate of our kingdom?

225
00:15:39,940 --> 00:15:43,440
Shimon, I fear this foretells
the fate of the entire world.

226
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:48,537
The order brought about by the seven
millennium items is falling apart,

227
00:15:48,620 --> 00:15:50,738
and I thought it would last forever.

228
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:53,431
How could one man have caused all of this?

229
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:56,500
What do you mean Akhenaten is gone?

230
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:59,917
When he awoke, I told him of
the young peasant girl we found,

231
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:02,118
and he stormed out in a fit of rage.

232
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:04,400
Oh no!

233
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:07,537
Guards, where has our guest gone?

234
00:16:07,620 --> 00:16:09,502
I thought you knew, Master Seto.

235
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:12,677
Akhenaten took her to the
subterranean battleground.

236
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:13,960
He did what?

237
00:16:14,220 --> 00:16:15,500
Did he say why?

238
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:20,380
Perhaps I can clarify the
situation, Master Seto.

239
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,840
Please, follow me.

240
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:41,500
No, this can't be.

241
00:16:41,800 --> 00:16:43,220
Let the battle commence!

242
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:46,300
Master Akhenaten has gone mad.

243
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:47,810
You there!

244
00:16:47,893 --> 00:16:49,700
This is no time to be resting!

245
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:52,597
Don't you know the rules of combat?

246
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:56,720
Now strike down your opponent,
lest you be struck down yourself!

247
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:58,280
Did he say opponent?

248
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:02,280
I said attack!

249
00:17:06,140 --> 00:17:09,000
Master Ak-Nah-Din, have
you lost your mind?

250
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:12,868
Forcing prisoners to engage in
battle for your own amusement?

251
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:14,800
No, I cannot allow this.

252
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:16,360
You must cease at once!

253
00:17:16,580 --> 00:17:17,600
Silence, Seto.

254
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:21,560
Can you not see that I am
executing your idea? Observe!

255
00:17:23,860 --> 00:17:24,690
Look!

256
00:17:24,780 --> 00:17:26,240
That monster is growing!

257
00:17:26,780 --> 00:17:27,610
Of course!

258
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:29,940
I took your plan to the next level.

259
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:33,237
You suggested we collect an
army of shadow creatures.

260
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:34,940
Yes, but not like this!

261
00:17:35,300 --> 00:17:39,760
I found a way to grow them by
forcing them to fight for survival.

262
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:41,660
As their rage increases,

263
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:45,397
so does the strength of the beast
that dwells within their hearts.

264
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:48,000
Now to finish you off! No!

265
00:17:48,300 --> 00:17:50,006
You shall never take me down!

266
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:55,120
Now then, I understand
the pharaoh is gone.

267
00:17:55,420 --> 00:17:59,057
Don't you think it's about time
we made the necessary provisions?

268
00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:00,820
The pharaoh is out there.

269
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:03,922
The royal guard is searching
for him as we speak.

270
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:05,020
Be realistic.

271
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:09,160
The time has come to call a
new pharaoh to the throne.

272
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:11,180
Someone who can save us.

273
00:18:11,780 --> 00:18:13,760
Someone like you, Sato.

274
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:16,797
But you cannot leave this empire alone.

275
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:20,417
You will need an army of
powerful creatures whose

276
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:23,441
might rivals that of the
Egyptian gods themselves.

277
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:28,280
And that is exactly what
I am creating for you.

278
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:31,960
Ah, what dark forces are at work here.

279
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:35,620
Now for the real battle.

280
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:38,637
Guards lead our next
prisoner to the battlefield.

281
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:39,550
Yes, sir.

282
00:18:42,140 --> 00:18:45,020
You cannot be serious about this.

283
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:46,390
Seto,

284
00:18:46,473 --> 00:18:48,897
I can assure you that this young woman is

285
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:51,940
not the meek peasant
girl she appears to be.

286
00:18:52,280 --> 00:18:53,456
All right, let's go.

287
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:57,940
She harbors the most dangerous
shadow creature we've ever seen.

288
00:18:58,700 --> 00:19:00,020
This is an outrage!

289
00:19:00,340 --> 00:19:03,752
I will not stand here while
you endanger an innocent girl!

290
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:08,480
Even if she is powerful, she has
done nothing to deserve this! Enough!

291
00:19:08,860 --> 00:19:10,460
Stop being so naive! Leave!

292
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:11,700
In this case,

293
00:19:11,860 --> 00:19:16,625
the innocent must be punished in order to
benefit the greater good of our people.

294
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:23,520
Trust me, this girl may be the
key to the survival of Egypt.

295
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,780
Seto, please help me.

296
00:19:36,060 --> 00:19:38,260
There is no other way!

297
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:41,120
Now, let the battle begin!
